<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi Cement Co 1996 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Saudi Cement Co 1996 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net profit		  426.8	vs     377.6</p>
<p> Operating income	  441.7	vs     388.2</p>
<p> Net operating income    410.9	vs     362.4</p>
<p> Total dividend	    367.2	vs     306.0</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds   2,250.2	vs   2,142.4</p>
<p> Assets		    2,666.2	vs   2,491.6</p>
<p>Full Name: Saudi Cement Company</p>
<p>Note: The Dammam-based firm, traded in the Saudi stock market, is one of eight cement companies operating in Saudi.</p>
</text>
